  "decision": {
    "phase_b_result": "PASS",
    "recommended_next_experiment": "1024px map-space tiled static cache with lazy tile materialization/streaming and viewport culling",
    "why_not_full_texture": "It is fastest in this CI spike, but the 8612x6898 2x RGBA8 cache is a single ~226.6 MiB raw image and the current process rises by about 302 MiB of video memory versus polygon baseline.",
